{"video":"H3Oj7ky4hYU","lines":[{"t":[0,4.8],"en":"Yeah, on the booze cruise, I told Michael about some feelings I used to have for Pam."},{"t":[5.9,9.8],"en":"I had just broken up with Katie and had a couple of drinks,"},{"t":[10.1,13.7],"en":"and I confided in the world's worst confidant."},{"t":[18.8,19.7],"en":"Hey, Mike."},{"t":[19.9,21],"en":"Hey, Jimbeck."},{"t":[22.9,25.7],"en":"Remember that thing I told you on the booze cruise about Pam?"},{"t":[26.1,28],"en":"That was personal."},{"t":[28.5,31.4],"en":"So if we could just keep that between you and me, that would be great."},{"t":[31.8,32.1],"en":"Really?"},{"t":[32.6,32.8],"en":"Mm-hmm."},{"t":[33.3,34],"en":"Who else knows?"},{"t":[34.3,34.6],"en":"Nobody."},{"t":[35.7,36.1],"en":"Wow."},{"t":[37.3,38.6],"en":"Jim and I are great friends."},{"t":[39,41.8],"en":"We hang out a ton, mostly at work."},{"t":[42.5,47],"en":"But the fact that he told me his secret and no one else says everything about our friendship."},{"t":[47.9,53],"en":"And it is why I intend on keeping that secret for as long as I possibly can."},{"t":[54.4,55.4],"en":"My lips are sealed."},{"t":[55.5,56.5],"en":"My lips are sealed."},{"t":[56.8,57.2],"en":"Bangles."},{"t":[57.2,57.6],"en":"All right."},{"t":[57.9,58.2],"en":"Great."},{"t":[58.6,59.1],"en":"Thank you."},{"t":[59.5,61.2],"en":"Can you hear me?"},{"t":[61.7,63.2],"en":"They talk about us."},{"t":[64,65.3],"en":"Telling lies."},{"t":[67.1,68],"en":"Hey, what you getting?"},{"t":[68.7,69.8],"en":"I'm going with grape."},{"t":[70,71.3],"en":"Ah, good stuff."},{"t":[71.4,72.5],"en":"Good stuff."},{"t":[73.9,75],"en":"See the game last night?"},{"t":[75.5,76],"en":"Which game?"},{"t":[77,77.7],"en":"Any of them."},{"t":[80.7,82.5],"en":"So, uh, what's 411?"},{"t":[82.9,85],"en":"Any updates on the, uh, the P situation?"},{"t":[85.8,86.3],"en":"I don't know."},{"t":[86.4,86.5],"en":"Any?"},{"t":[86.8,87.5],"en":"P-A-M?"},{"t":[87.5,87.9],"en":"Yeah, no."},{"t":[87.9,89.1],"en":"Oh, okay."},{"t":[89.9,90.4],"en":"No, it's okay."},{"t":[90.5,91.1],"en":"We're talking code."},{"t":[91.5,92.2],"en":"What is?"},{"t":[92.4,95],"en":"Listen, Stan, you know, how long does it take you for you to pick out a soda?"},{"t":[95.4,96.3],"en":"I'm going to take it off, actually."},{"t":[96.6,96.9],"en":"All right."},{"t":[97,98.3],"en":"Well, cool."},{"t":[104.6,106],"en":"Peach iced tea."},{"t":[108.1,109.1],"en":"You're going to hate it."},{"t":[113.8,116.4],"en":"It's grape soda."},{"t":[117,117.8],"en":"Tony the Tiger."},{"t":[118,118.3],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[118.4,119.4],"en":"You don't hear that much anymore."},{"t":[119.5,120.4],"en":"Not so much."},{"t":[120.6,121.9],"en":"Okay, what is going on here?"},{"t":[123.1,123.5],"en":"Nothing."},{"t":[124,124.6],"en":"Oh, really?"},{"t":[124.8,125],"en":"Nothing?"},{"t":[125.8,126.2],"en":"Fact."},{"t":[126.4,127.2],"en":"You were drinking grape soda."},{"t":[127.4,128.4],"en":"You never drink grape soda."},{"t":[128.8,129.2],"en":"Fact."},{"t":[129.4,130.4],"en":"You were talking to Jim."},{"t":[130.5,131.7],"en":"You never talked to Jim."},{"t":[131.8,132.1],"en":"Fact."},{"t":[132.3,133.3],"en":"I love grape soda."},{"t":[133.5,134.1],"en":"I always have."},{"t":[134.3,134.6],"en":"Fact."},{"t":[135,136.3],"en":"Jim and I talk all the time."},{"t":[136.7,137.7],"en":"We tell each other secrets."},{"t":[138.5,138.8],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[138.9,139.9],"en":"So what is the secret, Michael?"},{"t":[140,143.8],"en":"Um, I had asked Michael if I could head up the Oscar investigation,"},{"t":[144.2,149.5],"en":"and he said that only Dwight was capable of handling such sensitive material."},{"t":[152.3,153.1],"en":"Is that true?"},{"t":[155.4,158.4],"en":"Um, I don't know."},{"t":[158.7,158.9],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[160.1,160.6],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[160.9,162],"en":"Yeah, it is."},{"t":[162.6,163.4],"en":"Thank you, Michael."},{"t":[164.3,166],"en":"I know you're telling the truth."},{"t":[166.3,166.6],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[166.8,167.4],"en":"I can tell."},{"t":[168.5,169.5],"en":"I won't let you down."},{"t":[169.9,170.2],"en":"Good."},{"t":[171.2,171.6],"en":"Thanks."},{"t":[183.4,184],"en":"Expenses."},{"t":[185.2,186.5],"en":"Michael, is that a wig?"},{"t":[187.4,187.9],"en":"No."},{"t":[187.9,188],"en":"No."},{"t":[188,189.7],"en":"It's..."},{"t":[189.7,191.7],"en":"I wear it like that sometimes."},{"t":[191.9,192.5],"en":"Is that a wig?"},{"t":[193.5,194.8],"en":"This is from Hooters."},{"t":[195.4,195.7],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[195.9,196.6],"en":"It was a business lunch."},{"t":[197,197.9],"en":"Did Toby approve this?"},{"t":[197.9,198.9],"en":"No, he did not."},{"t":[198.9,200.1],"en":"I don't need his permission."},{"t":[200.9,203],"en":"You just got your corporate credit card back."},{"t":[203.1,204.7],"en":"Do you really want me to take it away again?"},{"t":[205.3,206.1],"en":"It's ridiculous."},{"t":[206.3,210.4],"en":"They took my card away because I spent 80 bucks at a magic shop."},{"t":[210.5,215.3],"en":"What they don't understand is that I bought the stuff to impress potential clients."},{"t":[215.4,217.5],"en":"So business-related, right?"},{"t":[217.9,220.4],"en":"I put a cigarette through a freaking quarter."},{"t":[221.3,222],"en":"And you know what, Toby?"},{"t":[222.3,223.7],"en":"They almost bought from us."},{"t":[224.1,225.5],"en":"I'm not processing us."},{"t":[225.5,228.4],"en":"Look, Jim needed a relaxing lunch."},{"t":[228.6,231.8],"en":"He has been depressed, and it has been affecting his productivity."},{"t":[231.9,233],"en":"How is that not work-related?"},{"t":[233.4,234.6],"en":"He seems fine to me."},{"t":[234.6,235.6],"en":"You're not his friend."},{"t":[235.7,236.3],"en":"You don't know."},{"t":[236.5,239.5],"en":"He is in love with a girl he works with who's engaged."},{"t":[239.6,241.5],"en":"So just cut me some slack, please."},{"t":[241.9,242.3],"en":"Pam?"},{"t":[242.3,269.5],"en":"Pam?"}]}
